---
layout: layout.njk
title: Seznam realitních makléřů
---

<div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">Naši realitní makléři</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-600 text-center mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Vyberte si profesionála, který vám pomůže najít váš vysněný domov.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        {% for m in makleri_data %}
        <a href="/web/{{ m.cele_jmeno | slugify }}/" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden relative">
                <img src="/assets/images/export_makleri/{{ m.id }}.jpg" 
                     alt="{{ m.cele_jmeno }}" 
                     class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
                     onerror="this.src='/assets/images/potensic-fallback.jpg.jpg'">
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
                    <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">{{ m.nabidky.length }} nabídek</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-1 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">{{ m.cele_jmeno }}</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-4">{{ m.email }}</p>
                <div class="flex items-center text-blue-600 font-bold text-sm">
                    Zobrazit profil <span class="ml-2">→</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</div>
